  factText: "Mycelium products blend industry and nature, ticking many green checkboxes.
    They cut waste and carbon (helping SDGs 12 and 13) and spark new innovation (SDG
    9). In plain terms, using mushroom materials is like nature\u2019s high-tech
    hack: fun, practical, and better for the planet."
